{"screen_name": "yottacc", "file": "yottacc-d891c6", "name": "悠tacC", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1977753462294331392/oueX8h0m.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/4708534754/1718298457/1500x500", "description": "喜欢画可爱的女孩子～ ※ かわいい女の子を描くのが好きなんだ！\n【Skeb】https://skeb.jp/@yottacc", "total_works": 7, "scraped_works": 7, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T16:06:08.196986+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T16:06:08.196986+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 21000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T16:06:08.196986+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 21000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 21000, "max": 21000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/yottacc", "name": "yottacc"}, {"label": "Misskey_io", "url": "https://misskey.io/@yottac", "name": "yottac"}, {"label": "Bluesky", "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/yottacc.com", "name": "yottacc.com"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://www.yottacc.com/", "name": ""}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/12727054", "name": "12727054"}, {"label": "Fanbox", "url": "https://yottacc.fanbox.cc", "name": "yottacc"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": false, "works": [{"path": "/@yottacc/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/68d4bf64/uploads/origins/4370eb6c-44ce-425e-b378-52162c6a01ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b4a78e27dcdba384ac374f2a7fc0d36", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/68d4bf64/uploads/origins/4370eb6c-44ce-425e-b378-52162c6a01ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b4a78e27dcdba384ac374f2a7fc0d36, https://si.imgix.net/68d4bf64/uploads/origins/4370eb6c-44ce-425e-b378-52162c6a01ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f079ea3cef5b630a52c567aa985d42ec 2x, https://si.imgix.net/68d4bf64/uploads/origins/4370eb6c-44ce-425e-b378-52162c6a01ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1df7be27b157ba08f637d0a1405a859 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "很高兴见到你！\n我对 YuuTacC 所绘插图的美丽和可爱色彩一见钟情。\n我想提出一个请求，希望你能表现出我深爱的女孩。\n\n这个角色是日本游戏《花骑士少女》中的史黛拉。\n她以星星（stella）和星星花（sutera）为主题，通过随意操纵光线与敌人战斗。\n您能说明她使用特殊招式的场景吗？......\n\n要求\n她在敌人出现时惊慌失措地释放特殊技的场景。\n动画中她正在冥想，但如果她能睁开眼睛就更好了。\n服装由您决定。基本服装是 \"https://pastelcrayon.net/flora/0459b.png\"。\n灯光应该是夜间的，这样光线会更突出。其他背景元素由我们决定。\n无需描述敌人。\n\n角色参考\nhttps://pastelcrayon.net/data/1049.html\nhttps://pastelcrayon.net/data/0607.html\nhttps://pastelcrayon.net/data/0459.html\n\n使用特殊动作的场景\nhttps://gyazo.com/bc480ce9bd49cb9b1f9c1c9c004d1434\n\n就这些了。\n如果您方便的话，请通过 ...... 与我们联系！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yottacc/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a6ab46a6/uploads/origins/1a319642-ee36-42df-a025-a5054d5fd090?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=618dc396824fbcdbe453f663e49bfec6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a6ab46a6/uploads/origins/1a319642-ee36-42df-a025-a5054d5fd090?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=618dc396824fbcdbe453f663e49bfec6, https://si.imgix.net/a6ab46a6/uploads/origins/1a319642-ee36-42df-a025-a5054d5fd090?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ef9ec09de02e1849d0888c3fa43031fc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a6ab46a6/uploads/origins/1a319642-ee36-42df-a025-a5054d5fd090?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=25ae7d403d6b478f45b1aee87c50c83c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yottacc/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/025a0781/uploads/origins/70b25df2-e339-4dd5-af64-c9add7204773?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21db354e911a434fcea7e4e23797f430", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/025a0781/uploads/origins/70b25df2-e339-4dd5-af64-c9add7204773?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21db354e911a434fcea7e4e23797f430, https://si.imgix.net/025a0781/uploads/origins/70b25df2-e339-4dd5-af64-c9add7204773?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f8384a96242c035b51754e8e75a0262 2x, https://si.imgix.net/025a0781/uploads/origins/70b25df2-e339-4dd5-af64-c9add7204773?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c50efb84c8c9554951d66f7a506b6dd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "你好，Yuu tacC，很高兴见到你！\n我在 X 上看到了你的插图，觉得风格很对我的胃口，所以想向你提个请求。\n我想请你画动画片《天国的方法》中的 Noel-chan。\n我不知道你是否知道这部作品或这个人物，所以我将给你一个关于 Noel-chan 的简单人物介绍。我想介绍一下 Noel-chan。她是一个非常有活力、天真无邪的女孩，虽然没有透露她的年龄，但她孩子般的外表和行为也很可爱。\n诺埃尔的照片请见 URL，以供参考。\n如图所示，她穿着平常的衣服，笑起来很开心，也很兴奋。YuuTacC 画出的微笑表情非常好看，所以我很希望能看到诺埃尔笑起来很好看的插图。\n其他具体细节，比如构图，就由我来决定吧。\n非常感谢。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1L_hb3fBgNPSRQJ7uekVEsRiGNcq_ok1_?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yottacc/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/de05b845/uploads/origins/c8c36f17-a1ff-4fb0-b041-480b2997f2a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1409dc478f3727ab036a58601ae8793a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/de05b845/uploads/origins/c8c36f17-a1ff-4fb0-b041-480b2997f2a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1409dc478f3727ab036a58601ae8793a, https://si.imgix.net/de05b845/uploads/origins/c8c36f17-a1ff-4fb0-b041-480b2997f2a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f995f856b1e59b3e02520d37bc90c162 2x, https://si.imgix.net/de05b845/uploads/origins/c8c36f17-a1ff-4fb0-b041-480b2997f2a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=026a97dd85fbe4807f953e9fd1c7fc19 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "新交付的插图非常可爱，我想提出一个请求。\n我想请您为我的游戏角色设计插画。\n(她将是一个两面朝天的女孩）。\n\n参考资料\nhttps://twitter.com/pso2satuki/status/1771572958848319512\n姿势、背景、服装安排等由我决定。 敬请合作！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yottacc/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f895026e/uploads/origins/3cf62b84-1893-4ef5-8e83-c87afd945c55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f4876a80dd810e254b8cb379d224c18", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f895026e/uploads/origins/3cf62b84-1893-4ef5-8e83-c87afd945c55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f4876a80dd810e254b8cb379d224c18, https://si.imgix.net/f895026e/uploads/origins/3cf62b84-1893-4ef5-8e83-c87afd945c55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c420d97fa8b6dcf66fa33a4029885dec 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f895026e/uploads/origins/3cf62b84-1893-4ef5-8e83-c87afd945c55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=429589d34dae3145cbb19bc0f38b525a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "你好，Yuu tacC，很高兴见到你！我叫艾尔卡！我是通过你为 Hara-Kami Clay 创作的插图认识你的！从那时起，我看过你过去的插图和新的插图，它们真的很可爱、很闪亮，我很喜欢它们！在我看来，你的插图是世界上最好的！对不起，我的前言很长，但我真的很抱歉！对不起，前言太长了！\n我想请你画一个叫 Kokoro Tsurumaki 的角色，她来自节奏游戏应用软件 Bandoli-chan！她是一个可爱、明朗、阳光的女孩，她用歌声让世界微笑！我们希望您能为她灿烂的笑容绘制一幅插图！请查看 URL 获取图片！姿势和服装可以按照图片上的样子来画，也可以按照 Yuu tacC 容易画的样子来画，由您来决定！如果您能帮我画出来，我会非常高兴！我知道您很忙，但还是希望您能考虑一下！\n非常感谢你的插图，它们总是非常可爱！我很喜欢！我会一直支持你的！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-9lOeZoc543Nyp0AB7BtlGIYWw5ls4vz", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yottacc/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ab47d625/uploads/origins/630f73da-cecd-4861-8c11-1114a6195249?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5d14bfcb8e00f02c1d75e036a7d0b536", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ab47d625/uploads/origins/630f73da-cecd-4861-8c11-1114a6195249?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5d14bfcb8e00f02c1d75e036a7d0b536, https://si.imgix.net/ab47d625/uploads/origins/630f73da-cecd-4861-8c11-1114a6195249?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f9f69e3575c2ecdb322d881e795f39e4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ab47d625/uploads/origins/630f73da-cecd-4861-8c11-1114a6195249?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de6c2c959daa3bfb1cd912df9d56dc3e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "很高兴见到你。\n我在 X 上看到了你的插图，我想向你发出请求，因为你画了一个非常可爱的女孩，我想委托你画她。\n我想请你为我的原创角色绘制插图。\n有关素材，请参阅下面的 URL。\n您可以自由绘制服装、姿势等。\n非常感谢您的考虑。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/mobile/folders/1VqRsAMCBIOihkMHptKSQTvpJXEZ3TlWQ?usp=share_link&pli=1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yottacc/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/972db8fe/uploads/origins/fb75ffb9-dd8a-4e39-b2d4-b7beb9da0bb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=89b35d7902f660e0b7110e93f8520fdc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/972db8fe/uploads/origins/fb75ffb9-dd8a-4e39-b2d4-b7beb9da0bb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=89b35d7902f660e0b7110e93f8520fdc, https://si.imgix.net/972db8fe/uploads/origins/fb75ffb9-dd8a-4e39-b2d4-b7beb9da0bb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf72e244dd28358325edcddf9d3f5e05 2x, https://si.imgix.net/972db8fe/uploads/origins/fb75ffb9-dd8a-4e39-b2d4-b7beb9da0bb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ba3ce78a76f1dea0f804666a8c2842b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "你好！我很喜欢你的作品，风格超级可爱！我希望你能为我的 OC 设计一套新衣服。\n\n她是一个年轻娇小的双尾狐狸女孩，耳朵和尾巴都很大。天蓝色的长发略显凌乱，发尾逐渐变白。\n\n只要是可爱的、色彩鲜艳的，我都会很高兴，我喜欢惊喜，但请保留她脖子上的蓝色丝带。你画的衣服总是那么可爱，如果你接受这个请求，我会很期待的。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1bEplXvuAB9WASdqZIAVUdEhboo804rRW?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}